# Verification harness (scripts/verify-rls.mjs) needs NO env vars: it spins up
# PGlite (real Postgres 17 compiled to WASM, in-process) and applies
# supabase/migrations/ to a fresh DB. Run: npm run verify:rls
# (A Docker Postgres URL is only needed if you prefer that harness instead.)
# Example: postgres://postgres:postgres@localhost:5433/postgres
# PG_TEST_URL=

